5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we should prioritize transparency and operational efficiency for this quarter's selection. I'll look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree that efficiency is key. I would like to look into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats to see where our capacity stands.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see everyone focusing on the health of our partnership. I would like to look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I think it's important to understand our long-term financial commitments and flexibility. I'll look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the actual execution phase. I want to look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings to see where the real bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have covered the operational, financial, and human resource aspects, I believe our current selection of inquiries is comprehensive. Does anyone feel we are missing a critical angle before we proceed?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have a well-balanced approach. By examining both our internal capacity and the external performance of our holdings, we should have a clear picture of which candidate fits our current situation best.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with you both. It feels as though we are all looking after one another's interests quite thoughtfully. I am content to proceed with these choices.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We have a broad range of data points. I'm satisfied with this distribution and ready to see what the findings reveal.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,It seems we are all in agreement. Let's move forward and see if the data actually supports the optimism in this room. I'm ready.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have all confirmed our choices and agree on the scope, I believe we have exhausted the need for further discussion in this round. I am ready to receive the findings.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
